    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The opening ceremony of the certificate course in education, 'A Window into the Histories and Cultures of Muslims', was held today at the Aga Khan University's Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED). The programme, the first of its kind, is being jointly conducted by the faculty of AKU's IED and the Institute for the Study of Muslim Civilisations.",
